<section class="auth-card" aria-labelledby="reset-heading">
  <h1 id="reset-heading">Reset password</h1>
  <p class="page-intro">Password reset links are issued by an administrator, and a link from an email cannot be redeemed on this page.</p>
  <p>If you received a new password from an administrator, sign in with it. If you lost access to your account, ask an administrator to reset your password.</p>
  <p class="auth-links">
    <a class="button" href="{{login_url}}">Back to sign in</a>
    <a class="button button-secondary" href="{{forgot_url}}">Forgot password</a>
  </p>
</section>
